<p class="fxbus-muted">
  Requires selected tiles. Apply starts if not running, otherwise updates.
</p>

<hr class="fxbus-divider"/>

<div class="fxbus-grid-2">
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Rotation (deg)</label>
    <input
      type="number"
      name="tileOscRotationDeg"
      value="1.5"
      step="0.1"
      min="-30"
      max="30"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Frequency (Hz)</label>
    <input
      type="number"
      name="tileOscFreqHz"
      value="0.25"
      step="0.05"
      min="0.01"
      max="10"
    />
  </div>
</div>

<div class="fxbus-grid-2">
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Bob (px)</label>
    <input
      type="number"
      name="tileOscBobPx"
      value="0"
      step="0.1"
      min="-200"
      max="200"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Sway (px)</label>
    <input
      type="number"
      name="tileOscSwayPx"
      value="3"
      step="0.1"
      min="-200"
      max="200"
    />
  </div>
</div>

<div class="fxbus-grid-2">
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Scale (%)</label>
    <input
      type="number"
      name="tileOscScalePct"
      value="0"
      step="0.1"
      min="-50"
      max="50"
    />
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label class="fxbus-inline" style="margin-top:22px;">
      <input type="checkbox" name="tileOscRandomPhase" checked/>
      Random phase per tile
    </label>
  </div>
</div>

<hr class="fxbus-divider"/>

<div class="form-group">
  <label class="fxbus-inline">
    <input type="checkbox" name="tileOscMotionSync"/>
    Synchronise with other oscillation FX
  </label>
</div>

<div class="fxbus-grid-2">
  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Sync group</label>
    <input type="text" name="tileOscSyncGroup" value="motion-1" disabled/>
  </div>

  <div class="form-group">
    <label>Phase offset (degrees)</label>
    <input
      type="number"
      name="tileOscSyncPhaseDeg"
      value="0"
      step="1"
      disabled
    />
  </div>
</div>

<p class="fxbus-muted">
  Motion Sync: effects in the same sync group share timing. New members join the current motion; frequency updates refresh the group rhythm without resetting phase.
</p>

<hr class="fxbus-divider"/>

<div class="fxbus-row">
  <button type="button" class="fxbus-do" data-do="tileOscApply">Apply</button>
  <button type="button" class="fxbus-do fxbus-smallbtn" data-do="tileOscStop">Stop</button>
  <button type="button" class="fxbus-do fxbus-smallbtn" data-action="fxbusCopyToMacro">Copy to Macro</button>
</div>
